{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221500","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221500","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322150001:1":{"text":"セントヤンコヴィッチ教会へようこそ！","source_cn":"各位朋友，欢迎你们来圣杨凯维奇教堂参观！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4693578E09D7B2D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322150002:1":{"text":"おめでとうございます、オグレさん！ここの在駐修道士になったんですよね！","source_cn":"哈哈哈，恭喜你成为这里的驻堂修士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E5E2B5542BA1A14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322150003:1":{"text":"ありがとうございます。それにしても、聖堂がテミシア様を遣わしてくださるなんて驚きです。でもあれだけのことがあったので、確かに普通の人では対処しきれませんよね。","source_cn":"真没想到圣堂会派特弥希娅大人前来。不过白山经历了这么一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FBB4BEC0005102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1322150003":{"text":"ありがとうございます。それにしても、聖堂がテミシア様を遣わしてくださるなんて驚きです。でもあれだけのことがあったので、確かに普通の人では対処しきれませんよね。","source_cn":"真没想到圣堂会派特弥希娅大人前来。不过白山经历了这么一团乱七八糟的事情，确实需要一位大人物来主持这里的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FBB4BEC0005102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322150005:1":{"text":"もちろん、生きた屍の浄化は、引き続きグレイヴボーンの方々と続けるつもりです。","source_cn":"当然，我会继续和那几位亡灵一起继续净化当地的活死人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ED70F1A09C3B7A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female